s left by Alice, and remember that your past may have been different from what you imagine.<br>Not everything is made of pain and suffering, just like your memories. The letters you received from Alice will help you recall the happy side of your life, you just need to find them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490760/extras/7db9d3eb39b676b75c688ba0bab9df87.poster.avif?t=1731766886\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490760/extras/7db9d3eb39b676b75c688ba0bab9df87.apng?t=1731766886\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>Explore the scenarios and eliminate enemies accompanied by a series of soundtracks that adapt to your combat situation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490760/extras/dbeb7efd6765c47f00b9df1d69f094cb.avif?t=1731766886\" /></span><br>Currently, the game is in the development phase, and many mechanics are yet to come. Get ready!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New platform and mobility mechanics<br></li><li>In-game cutscenes, narrated tales, and more story<br></li><li>Completely revamped endless mode<br></li><li>Level progression mechanic with improvement cards<br></li><li>New secrets: Magic Circle/Trial<br></li><li>Area bosses, various new enemies, 7 new stages, and new weapons<br></li><li>New visual effects<br></li><li>Enhancements in gamepad support</li></ul>",
